Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:18.031
I just saw Thor: Ragnarok and can confirm
the details of two end-credits scenes in the

00:00:18.031 --> 00:00:19.031
movie.

